comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T08:33:30.091Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check (all statuses): searched GH-974, preferred/retained/discarded, stable_value_order, and merge receipts. Closed pm-g5sx, pm-jtwsct, pm-rh98vo, and pm-dlx7v7 establish the merge/receipt lineage but none owns this exact self-contradictory preferred-side contract. This new open issue is canonical for #974."
